DreamVisualBatchMeshModifierHelper {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#DreamVisualBatchMeshModifierHelper
    src   "a helper class for UIGeometryModifierBase to easily modify ui geometry\n\nThe UITextHelperFunction_* calls address a text's characters by index, one glyph each. A text joins letters into\nligatures (\"fi\") by default, which would draw two such characters as one glyph, so a modifier that moves, turns,\nscales or colours characters one by one calls UDreamText::RegisterPerCharacterAnimation(Self) when it starts and\nUnregisterPerCharacterAnimation when it stops (TextAnimation does this for itself)."
    text  "一个辅助类，供UIGeometryModifierBase轻松修改UI几何体\n\nUITextHelperFunction_*系列调用按索引访问文本的字符，每个索引对应一个字形。文本默认会将字母合并为\n连字（“fi”），这样两个字符合并后只会绘制成一个字形，因此逐个移动、旋转、\n缩放或着色字符的修改器在启动时会调用UDreamText::RegisterPerCharacterAnimation(Self)，停止时调用\nUnregisterPerCharacterAnimation（TextAnimation会自行处理）。"
    state machine
}

DreamVisualBatchMeshModifierHelper:UITextHelperFunction_GetCharGeometry_AbsolutePosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#DreamVisualBatchMeshModifierHelper:UITextHelperFunction_GetCharGeometry_AbsolutePosition
    src   "Get character's pivot position relative to UIText's pivot position"
    text  "获取字符轴心点相对于UIText轴心点的位置"
    state machine
}

DreamVisualBatchMeshModifierHelper:UITextHelperFunction_GetCharHorizontalPositionRatio01 {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#DreamVisualBatchMeshModifierHelper:UITextHelperFunction_GetCharHorizontalPositionRatio01
    src   "Get character's center position in UIText's rect range, and convert to 0-1 range (left is 0 and right is 1)"
    text  "获取字符中心点在UIText矩形范围内的位置，并转换为0-1范围（左侧为0，右侧为1）"
    state machine
}

