EDreamMeshModifierStage {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#EDreamMeshModifierStage
    src   "When a modifier runs among the others on the same visual. Modifiers run stage by stage, and within a stage in the order\ntheir components sit on the widget."
    text  "修改器在同一可视对象上的其他修改器之间的运行时机。修改器按阶段运行，同一阶段内按\n组件在控件上的排列顺序运行。"
    state machine
}

EDreamMeshModifierStage.Characters {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#EDreamMeshModifierStage:Characters
    src   "Works on the vertices as the visual made them, a text's characters by their vertex ranges: animations, colours, UVs."
    text  "基于可视对象生成的顶点进行处理，文本的字符则按其顶点范围处理：动画、颜色、UV。"
    state machine
}

EDreamMeshModifierStage.Copies {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#EDreamMeshModifierStage:Copies
    src   "Appends whole copies of the mesh as the stages before left it (shadow, outline, long shadow): see GetDuplicatesMesh."
    text  "按前面阶段留下的网格追加完整副本（阴影、描边、长阴影）：参见GetDuplicatesMesh。"
    state machine
}

EDreamMeshModifierStage.Deform {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#EDreamMeshModifierStage:Deform
    src   "Reshapes the mesh by where each vertex is, cutting it finer first (warp, jelly). New vertices go after the old ones,\nwhich keep their indices, so a character's range still names its corners -- but no longer every vertex it draws."
    text  "根据每个顶点的位置重塑网格，先对其进行更细的切分（扭曲、果冻）。新顶点排在旧顶点之后，\n旧顶点保留其索引，因此字符的范围仍指向其各个角点——但不再涵盖它绘制的所有顶点。"
    state machine
}

EDreamMeshModifierStage.Layout {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierBase.h#EDreamMeshModifierStage:Layout
    src   "Places whole characters anew (text on a path). It still reads the characters' vertex ranges."
    text  "重新摆放整个字符（路径文本）。它仍会读取字符的顶点范围。"
    state machine
}

